<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact WhyTrashEarth by email, on X at @WhyTrashEarth, or on Discord using the username whytrashearth.">
  <article class="content">
    <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A direct line</p><h1>Get in touch.</h1><p class="intro">Questions, ideas, corrections, or a chance to work together — we’d like to hear from you.</p></header>
    <ul class="directory-list">
      <li><a href="mailto:wte23@pm.me?subject=Email%20from%20WTE%20Wiki"><Icon name="mail" /><span class="link-copy"><strong>Email WhyTrashEarth</strong><span>wte23@pm.me</span></span><Icon name="arrow" /></a></li>
      <li><a href="https://x.com/WhyTrashEarth"><Icon name="social" /><span class="link-copy"><strong>Message us on X</strong><span>@WhyTrashEarth</span></span><Icon name="external" /></a></li>
    </ul>
    <section class="note"><h2>Prefer Discord?</h2><p>To reach us on Discord, add us by username: <strong>whytrashearth</strong>.</p><p>Our Discord server is private.</p></section>
    <div class="prose"><h2>Response times</h2><p>We’re busy working on a range of public and private environmental projects, so response times may vary.</p><p>Thank you for your patience.</p><a class="text-link" href="/socials/">All official socials <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
